[{"answer":"There are seven days of the week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Sunday is a day of rest for some people","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/2.mp3"},{"answer":"but many people still have to work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Quite a few people go to church on a Sunday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/4.mp3"},{"answer":"On Monday morning, we go back to school after the weekend.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Many people say they don't like Monday because it is the beginning of the work week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Tuesday is a school day and a working day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think that there is anything special about a Tuesday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Wednesday is the middle of the work week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/9.mp3"},{"answer":"On Thursday, many of the stores and malls stay open later.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/10.mp3"},{"answer":"It gives you a chance to run some errands on a Thursday night.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/11.mp3"},{"answer":"On Friday, you feel like the work week is nearly over.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people say, \"thank goodness it is Friday\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/13.mp3"},{"answer":"They look forward to the weekend.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/14.mp3"},{"answer":"On Saturday, many people can sleep in late.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/15.mp3"},{"answer":"People get errands done on Saturday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/16.mp3"},{"answer":"You see a lot of people in the grocery store on a Saturday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Most children look forward to Saturday","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/18.mp3"},{"answer":"so that they can play with their friends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Then, Sunday comes again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/20.mp3"},{"answer":"The weeks turn into months, and the months turn into years.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Time goes by quite quickly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/44-days-of-the-week-2019-03-29-10-16-57/22.mp3"}]
